OL,3,GNEWSAPaddleboarder aims for
OL,4,Arecord-breaking challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA paddleboarder is preparing to spend
OL,7,Fup to five days and four nights at sea
OL,8,Fwithout touching land, in what he says
OL,9,Fis his toughest challenge yet.
OL,11,FBrendon Prince, from Torquay, will set
OL,12,Foff on Friday in a bid to paddle 311
OL,13,Fmiles (500km) non-stop, with the aim of
OL,14,Fbreaking the record for the longest
OL,15,Fcontinuous paddle without getting off a
OL,16,Fpaddleboard.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
