OL,3,GNEWSAPaddleboarder aims for
OL,4,Arecord-breaking challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrince, who previously paddleboarded
OL,7,Faround the coast of Great Britain said
OL,8,Fhe expected to cover about 125km (78
OL,9,Fmiles) a day, although the final
OL,10,Fdistance would depend on weather
OL,11,Fconditions.
OL,13,F"I'll stay on the board with all the
OL,14,Fkit, everything I need, eat, sleep,
OL,15,Fpaddle, repeat," he said.
